      "Etiology": "Extracardiac mechanical compression or intravascular blockades: Cardiac Tamponade, Tension Pneumothorax, Constrictive Pericarditis, Massive Pulmonary Embolism, Intracardiac Tumors (e.g., Atrial Myxoma), and severe Aortic/Pulmonary Stenosis.",
