      "Normal vs. Abnormal Values": "Normal CVP: 2–8 mmHg; Obstructive shock CVP: > 15–20 mmHg. Normal Cardiac Index: 2.5–4.0 L/min/m²; Obstructive shock Cardiac Index: < 2.0 L/min/m². Normal inspiratory SBP drop: < 10 mmHg; Pulsus Paradoxus: > 10–20 mmHg drop.",
