      "Treatment + Physiological Basis": "Immediate relief of mechanical obstruction (e.g., pericardiocentesis for tamponade, needle thoracostomy for tension pneumothorax) to restore diastolic filling or outflow; intravenous fluid boluses act as a temporary bridge to raise central venous pressure and force blood into the compressed heart.",
