      "Normal vs. Abnormal Values": "Normal Intrapericardial Pressure: -2 to +2 mmHg; Cardiac Tamponade Intrapericardial Pressure: > 15–20 mmHg (equalizing with right atrial and right ventricular end-diastolic pressures). Normal inspiratory SBP drop: < 10 mmHg; Pulsus Paradoxus: > 10–20 mmHg drop.",
