      "Clinical Features / Signature Symptoms": "- The Bends: Severe, deep aching pain in joint cavities and muscles of the arms and legs (appearing within 30 minutes of surfacing).\n- Neurological Deficits: Sensory paresthesias, motor weakness, paralysis, dizziness, collapse, or unconsciousness due to microvascular occlusion in the brain and spinal cord.\n- The Chokes: Severe dyspnea, chest compression, and pulmonary edema caused by microbubbles plugging pulmonary capillaries (~2% of cases).\n- Cardiovascular: Myocardial ischemia caused by coronary vessel bubble emboli.",
