      "Sequence of Changes": "Sleep onset -> Pharyngeal muscle hypotonia -> Upper airway obstruction -> Apnea (> 10 s) -> Progressive arterial PO2 drop & PCO2 rise -> Chemoreceptor arousal -> Sudden loud gasp/snort -> Airway opens -> Brief hyperventilation -> Sleep resumes -> Repeated cycle.",
