      "Definition": "A gastrointestinal disorder occurring when incompetence or abnormal transient relaxation of the lower esophageal sphincter (LES) allows retrograde flow of acidic gastric juice into the esophagus, causing esophageal mucosal injury and inflammatory esophagitis.",
