      "Receptors / Channels / Transporters": "Voltage-Gated Calcium Channels (alpha-2-delta subunit targeted by Gabapentin/Pregabalin).",
      "Differential Diagnosis": "Cervical Spondylotic Myelopathy, Intramedullary Spinal Cord Tumor, ALS (lacks sensory loss), Tabes Dorsalis (posterior column loss without thermoanalgesia).",
