      "Drugs": "Tetrabenazine, Deutetrabenazine, Haloperidol, Risperidone, Olanzapine.",
      "Receptors / Channels / Transporters": "Vesicular Monoamine Transporter 2 (VMAT2), D2 Dopamine Receptors, GABA-A Receptors.",
      "Differential Diagnosis": "Athetosis (slow, writhing movements; globus pallidus/striatum lesion), Hemiballismus (violent, flailing movements; subthalamic nucleus lesion), Parkinson's Disease (hypokinetic vs hyperkinetic), Tardive Dyskinesia.",
