      "Clinical Features / Signature Symptoms": "- **Astereognosis:** Inability to recognize complex objects, shapes, or forms by touch/palpation with eyes closed.\n- **Contralateral Body Oblivion / Personal Neglect:** Forgetting or being oblivious to the presence of the opposite side of the body.\n- **Motor Neglect:** Forgetting to use the contralateral arm/hand for voluntary tasks despite intact muscle strength.\n- **Dressing / Hygiene Neglect:** Forgetting to dress, shave, or wash the contralateral half of the body.\n- Loss of sense of weight, texture, and 3D form of objects felt on the opposite side.",
