      "Treatment + Physiological Basis": "- Early Detection and Removal of Obstruction: Surgical removal of congenital cataracts or correction of strabismus/refractive errors before 6 years of age.\n- Occlusion Therapy (Patching the Sound Eye): Patching the normal eye forces the brain to use the suppressed eye, promoting neuroplasticity and restoring ocular dominance column representation in V1 before the critical period ends.",
