      "Differential Diagnosis": "Anosmia (complete loss of smell), Dysosmia/Parosmia (distorted smell perception), Olfactory Hallucinations, Allergic Rhinitis.",
      "Complications": "Inability to detect hazardous environmental smells (gas leaks, smoke, spoiled food), loss of appetite, and nutritional decline."
